                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: In which location is it most common for a child to sit at a desk?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- A child is most likely to sit at a desk in a setting where they need to study or do schoolwork.\n- Option A, furniture store, does not fit this criteria as it is a place to purchase furniture, not a place for studying.\n- Option C, patio, is also unlikely as it is an outdoor area and not typically used for studying.\n- Option D, office building, may have desks but it is not a place where children typically study.\n- Option E, library, is a place where children often go to study and do schoolwork, but it is not the only place.\n- Therefore, the most likely location for a child to sit at a desk is in a schoolroom.\n \nAnswer: B) schoolroom",
