                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What are the possible causes of death from eating a hamburger?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\n- A) Gas: This answer doesn't make sense as gas from eating a hamburger wouldn't be fatal.\n- B) Getting full: While it's possible to overeat and feel uncomfortable, getting full from a hamburger wouldn't typically cause death.\n- C) Mad cow disease: This is a possibility as contaminated beef can cause variant Creutzfeldt-Jakob disease (vCJD), a rare and fatal brain disorder.\n- D) Death: This is a vague answer and doesn't provide a specific cause of death.\n- E) Feel full: This is similar to answer B and doesn't address the possibility of death.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is C) mad cow disease.",
