                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: Examining things closely can provide a better understanding of their characteristics, features, and qualities. It can also help in making informed decisions, identifying potential issues or problems, and gaining knowledge about a particular subject.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What are the benefits of examining something closely?\n2. What are the different reasons for examining something closely?\n3. How does examining something closely help in making informed decisions?\n4. What are the potential issues or problems that can be identified by examining something closely?\n5. How does examining something closely help in gaining knowledge about a particular subject?\n\nAnswers:\n1. The benefits of examining something closely include gaining a better understanding of its characteristics, features, and qualities, identifying potential issues or problems, making informed decisions, and gaining knowledge about a particular subject.\n2. The different reasons for examining something closely can include buying it, learning about it, understanding its complexity, or finding it interesting.\n3. Examining something closely can help in making informed decisions by providing a better understanding of its features, qualities, and potential issues or problems.\n4. Potential issues or problems that can be identified by examining something closely can include defects, malfunctions, or inconsistencies in its design, structure, or performance.\n5. Examining something closely can help in gaining knowledge about a particular subject by providing a detailed understanding of its characteristics, features, and qualities, as well as its historical, cultural, or scientific significance.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "2e5823e2-358e-405c-9513-8d3d29f1f2d2",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "all of the above (A, B, D, and E) as examining something closely can serve multiple purposes such as buying, learning about, understanding complexity, or finding something interesting.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "E",
                                "correct_answer": false
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
