ost likely diagnosis is a respiratory infection with possible oral thrush and failure to thrive. The best option to confirm the diagnosis would be to perform a respiratory viral panel to identify the specific virus causing the infection. Therefore, the correct answer is D) Polymerase chain reaction for viral genes.",
