g its lipooligosaccharide (LOS) to prevent complement deposition. Therefore, the component that is likely deficient in this patient is the complement component that is responsible for creating pores in the cell membrane, which is option D.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D) Creates pores in the cell membrane.",
